      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>When arranging bike transportation to or within Cambay, meticulous preparation of paperwork is essential to avoid delays, fines, and insurance complications. Below is a concise guide to the key documents you must assemble and the rationale behind each.</p>

<h3>Essential Documents for Bike Transportation in Cambay</h3>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #f59e0b22; color: #f59e0b; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">01</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Self‑Attested RC Photocopy</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Registration Certificate (RC) confirms the bike’s legal ownership and registration details. A self‑attested photocopy, signed by the owner and notarized if required, ensures the transporter has a verifiable record of the bike’s identity.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Current Pollution Under Control (PUC) Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">PUC certifies that the motorcycle meets environmental emission standards. Transporters must verify that the certificate is valid for the duration of transit; otherwise, the vehicle may be detained at checkpoints.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Valid Insurance Certificate</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Proof of an active motor‑vehicle insurance policy protects the owner and the carrier against accidental damage or loss. The certificate should list coverage limits, policy number, and the insurer’s contact details.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #a855f722; color: #a855f7; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">04</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA‑Approved Consignment Bilty</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">The Indian Bill of Lading (IBL) or consignment bilty issued by the Indian Bureau of Shipping (IBA) is the formal transport contract. It details the consignor, consignee, mode of transport, freight charges, and terms of delivery, serving as the primary legal document during transit.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<h3>Why 100% Declared‑Value Marine Transit Insurance Matters</h3>
<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">Marine transit, whether by sea or inland waterways, exposes the bike to risks such as rough handling, theft, or damage from environmental factors.</p>
<ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin: 16px 0 20px 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px;"><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>A 100% declared‑value policy ensures that the full market value of the motorcycle is insured.</span></li><li style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.07); padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 8px; font-size: 0.92rem; line-height: 1.55; color: #cbd5e1;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 4px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.9rem;"></i><span>This coverage protects the consignor against total loss or significant depreciation, providing peace of mind and financial security throughout the shipping journey.</span></li></ul>

<p>In addition to the core documents, it is prudent to:</p>
<ul>
<li>Verify the transporter’s license and reputation through the Ministry of Shipping registry.</li>
<li>Confirm that the vehicle’s chassis number is recorded in the consignment bilty.</li>
<li>Keep a digital backup of all documents, accessible via secure cloud storage.</li>
<li>Schedule a pre‑shipment inspection to document the bike’s condition and capture photographic evidence.</li>
</ul></div>
