<p>The enclosed hydraulic ramp carrier acts as a self‑leveling platform that can be raised or lowered within a sealed steel cage. Hydraulics provide a smooth lift of up to 1.8 m, allowing the bike or scooter to roll onto the carrier without manual handling.</p>
<p>The enclosure protects the vehicle from dust, rain, and road debris, which is essential for long hauls across the Gujarat hinterland and for inter‑state rail shipments.</p>

<p>Once positioned, each wheel is secured by an individual steel wheel‑lock chock. The chocks clamp around the tyre rim and lock with a keyed mechanism, preventing any rotation or lateral movement. This is especially critical when the carrier is subjected to acceleration, braking, or cornering forces on national highways.</p>

<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">To complement the chocks, a high‑tensile ratchet lashing system is installed across the bike’s frame and handlebars.</p>
