    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Booking &amp; Tracking Integration:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Use the “bike parcel service train” portal to reserve a slot. When you “how to book bike parcel in train” or search for “bike parcel irctc”, the system will provide the exact “bike parcel in train timings” and allow real‑time tracking.</p>
