      <div style="font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #cbd5e1;"><p>In the context of destination delivery handover for two-wheelers and motorcycles, specific procedures must be followed to ensure a thorough assessment and verification of the vehicle's condition. These procedures include daylight condition re-inspection, comparing pickup photos with the delivered vehicle, verifying odometer readings, and obtaining a signed condition sign-off.</p>

<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr)); gap: 20px; margin-top: 24px;">
