  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Make sure the odometer reading matches the distance mentioned in the LR bill of lading, ensuring that the vehicle has not been tampered with or had its odometer rolled back.</span></li>
  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>If the odometer reading does not match or appears suspicious, consult with the concerned parties and verify the authenticity of the odometer.</span></li>
