  <li style="margin-bottom: 10px; display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 10px;"><i class="fas fa-check-circle" style="color: #10b981; margin-top: 5px; flex-shrink: 0; font-size: 0.95rem;"></i><span>Collect a copy of the signed document as proof of condition verification and to ensure clear communication between all parties involved.</span></li>
</ul>

<p>By performing these steps, you can ensure a comprehensive examination of the motorcycle or two-wheeler before handing it over to the recipient.</p>

<p>In addition to the visual inspection, it is advisable to listen for any unusual noises, evaluate the functionality of lights, brakes, and other vital components.</p>

<p>If any major discrepancies or concerns are identified during the inspection, it is crucial to document them thoroughly and consult with the concerned parties to resolve the issue prior to completing the handover.</p>

